The HBT cells also run VBIC 1.3 models (models/osdi/vbic_1p3_5t.osdi, and for harmonicaRF
vbic_1p3_bce.osdi and npn13G2*.osdi). Neither this repository nor its release archives contain them:
generator/build-vbic.sh compiles them with OpenVAF, where the kit is used, from the vbic_1p3.va that
VACASK (https://codeberg.org/arpadbuermen/VACASK) distributes. That file states no license of its own.
